# Optional root-level overrides for the local Tilt stack.
# `make tilt` uses a checkout-specific sslip.io app domain unless this is set.
# Set only the base zone (no `*.`); Tilt applies it consistently to the
# Infrastructure provider and local preview Gateway.
# RAILGRID_APP_BASE_DOMAIN=apps.example.com

# Optional client-facing HTTPS port in generated app URLs. Leave unset to use
# Tilt's local preview port. Set empty when a trusted front proxy publishes 443.
# RAILGRID_APP_PUBLIC_PORT=
